<view class="page"><view class="title">让下一次养护有安排</view><view class="subtitle">{{vehicle.name}}</view><view class="field"><view class="label">项目名称 *</view><input class="input" value="{{form.name}}" maxlength="40" data-field="name" bindinput="input" placeholder="例如：机油机滤、车险续期"/></view><view class="switch-row"><text>设置到期日期</text><switch checked="{{dateEnabled}}" color="#065f46" bindchange="enableDate"/></view><picker wx:if="{{dateEnabled}}" mode="date" value="{{pickerDate}}" bindchange="dateChange"><view class="picker">{{form.dueDate}} ▾</view></picker><view class="field"><view class="label">到期累计里程 · km（选填）</view><input class="input" type="number" value="{{form.dueMileage}}" data-field="dueMileage" bindinput="input" placeholder="例如：30000"/></view><view class="notice">日期和里程至少填一项；同时填写时，任一条件先到即提醒。</view><view class="section-title spaced">完成后的重复周期</view><view class="grid"><view class="field"><view class="label">每隔几个月</view><input class="input" type="number" value="{{form.intervalMonths}}" data-field="intervalMonths" bindinput="input" placeholder="不重复可留空"/></view><view class="field"><view class="label">每隔多少公里</view><input class="input" type="number" value="{{form.intervalKm}}" data-field="intervalKm" bindinput="input" placeholder="不重复可留空"/></view></view><view class="tiny">重复计划从最近一次实际完成日期 / 里程起算。修改周期会重算下次到期，修改首次到期值不影响已有完成记录。</view><view class="grid"><view class="field"><view class="label">提前几天提醒</view><input class="input" type="number" value="{{form.leadDays}}" data-field="leadDays" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="field"><view class="label">提前多少公里</view><input class="input" type="number" value="{{form.leadKm}}" data-field="leadKm" bindinput="input"/></view></view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><button class="primary" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving || !ready || vehicle.archived}}" bindtap="save">保存计划</button><button wx:if="{{form.id}}" class="danger spaced" bindtap="remove">删除计划</button><view class="footer-note">本版为站内提醒。周期请以车辆手册、实际到期日为准。</view></view>
